
# 🇮🇹 Italian Barrista Café App

A mobile-friendly digital menu for Italian Barrista Café, featuring food and drink items, prices in Omani Rial (OMR), and a simple menu management panel.

## ✨ Features

- 📱 Mobile-friendly menu
- 🍕 Food and beverage categories
- 💰 Prices in Omani Rial (OMR)
- 🌐 English and Arabic menu text support
- 🖼️ Add photos to menu items
- ✏️ Edit item names, descriptions, and prices
- ➕ Add new menu items
- 🗑️ Delete menu items
- 🔴 Mark items as sold out
- 💾 Save menu changes locally on the device

## 🛠️ Built With

- HTML
- CSS
- JavaScript
- Android WebView
- Gradle

## 🚀 How to Use

1. Open the app on your Android device.
2. Browse the available menu items.
3. Use the menu management panel to update items.
4. Add item photos, descriptions, and prices as needed.

## 🔐 Admin Access

The standalone demo uses PIN `1234`.

**Important:** This PIN is for demonstration only. Do not use it to protect sensitive information in a production app.

## 💵 Currency and Tax

- Currency: Omani Rial (OMR)
- Menu prices are intended to include 5% tax, as stated in the café menu.

Confirm all prices and tax settings before publishing.

## 📦 Build the Android APK

This repository can be configured to build an Android APK using GitHub Actions.

1. Upload the Android project files to this repository.
2. Check the **Actions** tab on GitHub.
3. Open the Android build workflow.
4. Wait for the workflow to finish successfully.
5. Download the APK artifact if the build succeeds.

## ⚠️ Limitations

- Menu edits and photos are stored locally on the device/browser.
- Changes are not automatically shared between customers' devices.
- Online ordering, payment processing, and delivery integration are not included in the demo.
- The app needs further testing before public release.

